<% } %>

| Account | Value |
| :-- | --: |
| Profile | [@<%= LOGIN %>](https://github.com/<%= LOGIN %>) |
| Joined GitHub | <%= f.date(REGISTRATION_DATE, {date: true, timeZone: config.timezone?.name}) %> (<%= computed.registration %>) |
| Followers | <%= f(FOLLOWERS) %> |
| Following | <%= f(FOLLOWING) %> |
| Organizations | <%= f(ORGANIZATIONS) %> |
| Repositories contributed to | <%= f(REPOSITORIES_CONTRIBUTED_TO) %> |
| Repositories starred | <%= f(STARRED) %> |
| Repositories watched | <%= f(WATCHING) %> |
| Repositories sponsored | <%= f(SPONSORING) %> |

### Development activity

| Activity | Count |
| :-- | --: |
| Commits | <%= f(COMMITS) %> |
| Pull requests opened | <%= f(PULL_REQUESTS) %> |
| Pull requests reviewed | <%= f(PULL_REQUESTS_REVIEWS) %> |
| Issues opened | <%= f(ISSUES) %> |
| Issue comments | <%= f(ISSUE_COMMENTS) %> |

### Repository statistics

| Repository metric | Value |
| :-- | --: |
| [Repositories](https://github.com/<%= LOGIN %>?tab=repositories) | <%= repositorySummary %> |
| License preference | <%= mdCell(licensePreference) %> |
| Releases | <%= f(RELEASES) %> |
| Packages | <%= f(PACKAGES) %> |
| Repository storage | <%= computed.diskUsage %> |
| Lines changed | <%= mdCell(linesSummary) %> |
| Sponsors | <%= f(SPONSORS) %> |
| Stargazers | <%= f(STARGAZERS) %> |
| Forkers | <%= f(FORKS) %> |
| Watchers | <%= f(WATCHERS) %> |
| Repository traffic | <%= mdCell(trafficSummary) %> |

<% if (plugins.languages) { %>
## Languages

<% if (pluginError(plugins.languages)) { %>
> **Language data unavailable:** <%= pluginError(plugins.languages) %>
<% } else if (LANGUAGES.length) { %>
<%= f(plugins.languages.unique) %> languages detected across analyzed repositories.

| Language | Share | Size |
| :-- | --: | --: |
<% for (const {name, value, size} of LANGUAGES) { -%>
| <%= mdCell(name) %> | <%= f.percentage(value) %> | <%= f.bytes(size) %> |
<% } -%>
<% if (plugins.languages.partial?.global || plugins.languages.partial?.repositories) { %>
> **Partial results:** language analysis reached its execution limit.
<% } %>
<% } else { %>
No language data was returned.
<% } %>
<% } %>

<% if (plugins.habits) { %>
## Recent coding habits

<% if (pluginError(plugins.habits)) { %>
> **Coding habit data unavailable:** <%= pluginError(plugins.habits) %>
<% } else if (plugins.habits.commits?.fetched) { %>
Computed from the last <%= f(plugins.habits.commits.fetched) %> recent push events.

<% if (plugins.habits.indents.style) { %>
- Uses **<%= plugins.habits.indents.style %>** for indentation.
<% } %>
<% if (plugins.habits.lines.average.chars) { %>
- Writes approximately **<%= f(plugins.habits.lines.average.chars, {fixed: 1}) %> characters** per line.
<% } %>
<% if (!Number.isNaN(plugins.habits.commits.hour)) { %>
- Most often pushes code around **<%= plugins.habits.commits.hour %>:00**.
<% } %>
<% if (plugins.habits.commits.day) { %>
- Is most active on **<%= plugins.habits.commits.day %>**.
<% } %>

<details>
<summary>Activity breakdown</summary>

### Push events by weekday

| Day | Push events |
| :-- | --: |
<% for (let day = 0; day < dayNames.length; day++) { -%>
| <%= dayNames[day] %> | <%= f(plugins.habits.commits.days[day] ?? 0) %> |
<% } -%>

<% if (numericEntries(plugins.habits.commits.hours).length) { %>
### Active hours

| Hour | Push events |
| :-- | --: |
<% for (const [hour, count] of numericEntries(plugins.habits.commits.hours).filter(([, count]) => count)) { -%>
| <%= `${hour}`.padStart(2, "0") %>:00 | <%= f(count) %> |
<% } -%>
<% } %>

<% if (plugins.habits.linguist?.available && plugins.habits.linguist.ordered?.length) { %>
### Recently used languages

| Language | Share |
| :-- | --: |
<% for (const [language, share] of plugins.habits.linguist.ordered) { -%>
| <%= mdCell(language) %> | <%= f.percentage(share) %> |
<% } -%>
<% } %>

</details>
<% } else { %>
No recent push activity was found.
<% } %>
<% } %>

