<% if (plugins.reactions) { %>
### Reactions

<% if (pluginError(plugins.reactions)) { %>
> **Reaction data unavailable:** <%= pluginError(plugins.reactions) %>
<% } else { %>
Based on <%= f(plugins.reactions.comments) %> comments with <%= f(plugins.reactions.total) %> reactions.

| Reaction | Count | Share |
| :--: | --: | --: |
<% for (const [reaction, icon] of Object.entries(reactionIcons)) { const data = plugins.reactions.list[reaction] ?? {}; -%>
| <%= icon %> | <%= f(data.value ?? 0) %> | <%= f.percentage(data.percentage ?? 0) %> |
<% } -%>
